[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

; A bird of paradise from the landscape kit (2026-09-29): broad paddle leaves
; on stiff stalks fanning up from a sheathed base, low outer leaves drooping
; over the soil, orange-and-blue flowers held out on their own stalks; about
; 1.7 m tall and 2 m across. The shape is
; `assets/source/props/bird_of_paradise.blend`; Send to game writes the GLB.
; `variant` picks the clump. Visual only.

